instrument wingie
; first light: the Wingie's microphones ring two sets of sympathetic strings.
; the keys tune them (left an octave below right), fader1 (Mix) is how much the
; small room holds, fader2 (Decay) how long the strings ring, fader3 (Volume) how
; loud the room is. The left LED follows what the mics hear, the right one the room.

first light
-----------
the low is sympathetic 2
the high is sympathetic 4
the room is reverblite 2
the loud is vca
the oct1 is transpose
the oct2 is transpose
octave1 -> oct1
keys1.pitch -> oct1.pitch
octave2 -> oct2
keys2.pitch -> oct2.pitch
mic.left -> low
mic.right -> high
oct1 -> low.pitch
oct2 -> high.pitch
fader2 -> low.decay high.decay
low -> left
high -> right
low high ~> room
fader1 -> room.size
room -> loud
fader3 -> loud.gain
loud -> out
mic.both -> lights.left
room -> lights.right

the dark
--------
the toll is comb 2
the shelf is filterbank
the oct1 is transpose
octave1 -> oct1
keys1.pitch -> oct1.pitch
mic.both -> toll
oct1 -> toll.pitch
fader2 -> toll.decay
toll -> shelf
fader1 -> shelf.band2
fader3 -> shelf.band5
shelf -> out
toll -> lights.left
shelf -> lights.right
